            {
              "title": "You send shirts",
              "body": "Washed, no hangers. I can work around stains and small holes."
            },
            {
              "title": "I stabilize and cut",
              "body": "Fusible on the back, then a square or rectangle that keeps the graphic."
            },
            {
              "title": "You approve the grid",
              "body": "A photo of the design wall. We move blocks before anything is sewn."
            },
            {
              "title": "Quilt and bind",
              "body": "Edge-to-edge on the longarm. Machine binding. Washable."
